- Congratulations, boss... that is, sir!
- Congratulations, boss... that is, sir!

268
00:21:05.681 --> 00:21:07.933
I will come back another time. Be there.

269
00:21:09.101 --> 00:21:10.811
Wait, sir!

270
00:21:13.355 --> 00:21:14.523
Please don't go.

271
00:21:20.404 --> 00:21:21.822
Don't worry.

272
00:21:21.905 --> 00:21:23.031
The boss, that is…

273
00:21:23.782 --> 00:21:25.867
Customers will appear.

274
00:21:31.373 --> 00:21:34.334
<i>It's been a week since
head No Suk Min jumped from the roof,</i>

275
00:21:34.418 --> 00:21:37.296
<i>and the body still hasn't been found.</i>

276
00:21:37.379 --> 00:21:41.341
<i>Despite relentless search and investigation,</i>

277
00:21:41.425 --> 00:21:46.221
<i>police and firefighters
have not yet found any evidence.</i>

278
00:21:46.305 --> 00:21:47.556
Is it possible…

279
00:21:47.639 --> 00:21:51.476
<i>Meanwhile, the police are continuing their investigation
regarding No</i>'s head

280
00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:53.437
<i>for further charges.</i>

281
00:23:36.998 --> 00:23:38.125
Nothing.

282
00:23:39.709 --> 00:23:41.336
I was alone from the beginning.

283
00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:48.385
Everything just returned to its original state.

284
00:25:42.290 --> 00:25:43.458
It's warm.

285
00:25:49.089 --> 00:25:50.173
Ku Vone?

286
00:26:08.441 --> 00:26:09.818
{\an8}SIDE A:
"MIRE NUTRITION"

287
00:26:13.530 --> 00:26:16.658
SIGNING CEREMONY
MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING

288
00:26:16.741 --> 00:26:18.243
- Thank you.
- And thank you.

289
00:26:22.414 --> 00:26:23.290
Thank you!

290
00:26:23.373 --> 00:26:25.375
Congratulations.

291
00:26:27.168 --> 00:26:28.128
It looks great.

292
00:26:28.211 --> 00:26:29.337
let's eat

293
00:26:29.421 --> 00:26:32.257
This restaurant must be great.

294
00:26:32.340 --> 00:26:34.217
Then eat as quietly as you can.

295
00:26:34.301 --> 00:26:35.468
- It's worth it.
- Let's eat.

296
00:26:36.052 --> 00:26:36.886
Thank you.

297
00:26:38.054 --> 00:26:38.930
Very tasty.

298
00:26:40.223 --> 00:26:41.766
- Let me pour you.
- Please.

299
00:26:43.685 --> 00:26:45.937
- Let's make a toast, Mrs. To.
- Of course.

300
00:26:46.021 --> 00:26:49.274
Let's raise our glasses to beauty, enthusiasm,
goodness and joy!

301
00:26:49.357 --> 00:26:50.567
For CEDAR!

302
00:26:53.945 --> 00:26:54.988
For CEDAR!

303
00:26:55.989 --> 00:26:57.615
- For CEDAR!
- For CEDAR!

304
00:26:57.699 --> 00:26:58.616
CEDAR...

305
00:27:03.788 --> 00:27:07.000
Now that we are entering the US market,
Shall we go on a business trip to New York?

306
00:27:07.876 --> 00:27:09.961
I will study English very hard.

307
