308
00:27:13.548 --> 00:27:14.799
Why didn't you tell me?

309
00:27:14.883 --> 00:27:16.384
- For CEDAR!
- For CEDAR!

310
00:27:20.263 --> 00:27:21.931
Let's drink another glass!

311
