443
00:44:21.742 --> 00:44:23.327
You are a lousy courtesan.

444
00:44:23.410 --> 00:44:25.162
Do you even know who I am?

445
00:44:26.830 --> 00:44:28.624
- Please, take it easy.
- Don't do it like that.

446
00:44:29.833 --> 00:44:31.251
- Calm down.
- Let go!

447
00:44:31.335 --> 00:44:32.670
Well, because

448
00:44:35.964 --> 00:44:36.799
calm down

449
00:44:38.217 --> 00:44:40.219
Probably considers
who still works for officials,

450
00:44:40.302 --> 00:44:41.720
she behaves so arrogantly.

451
00:44:44.807 --> 00:44:45.724
She can hear.

452
00:44:46.850 --> 00:44:49.645
She has been here for many days
but she didn't say a word to us.

453
00:44:50.604 --> 00:44:53.315
Government courtesan
obviously does not understand our language.

454
00:44:54.900 --> 00:44:56.944
just to think
that the famous government courtesan

455
00:44:57.027 --> 00:44:59.363
